  "body": "Vendor has purchased so this property is seriously for sale. \r\n\r\nSingle-level ease and a lifestyle location that’s hard to beat. Some addresses simply make life easier. Tucked away in a quiet Stanmore Bay cul-de-sac, this is one of them.\r\n\r\nBuilt in 2007, this single-level, cavity plaster home on a freehold section offers the space, comfort and convenience families are searching for, with four bedrooms, two bathrooms and a double garage providing a practical foundation for easy everyday living.\r\n\r\nBut the real magic lies just beyond your doorstep. Forget the daily car shuffle. Walk to school, the leisure centre for sports, swimming lessons and gym sessions, then cross the road to the skate park and beautiful Stanmore Bay Beach. From active afternoons to relaxed weekends by the water, this is coastal living at its most convenient.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re upsizing or downsizing, raising a family or securing your place in a sought-after seaside community, the appeal here is undeniable. A peaceful setting, a practical single-level layout and an enviable lifestyle all come together in one compelling package.\r\n\r\nMotivated sellers have purchased another property and are committed to their next chapter.",
